@startuml
actor Utilisateur
participant "Frontend React" as Front
participant "Backend FastAPI" as API
participant "ReportService" as Report
database "SQLite" as DB
Utilisateur -> Front : Choisir periode
Front -> API : GET /reports/summary
API -> Report : verifier role et periode
Report -> DB : charger interventions
DB --> Report : interventions filtrees
Report -> DB : charger frais lies
DB --> Report : frais
Report --> API : ReportSummary
API --> Front : JSON statistiques
Front --> Utilisateur : Afficher rapport
Utilisateur -> Front : Exporter CSV
Front --> Utilisateur : rapport-caidelec.csv
@enduml
